---
// SchoolForms component - SF-10 & SF-9 integration explained simply
---

<section id="school-forms" class="relative bg-[#f8fafc] py-20 border-t border-slate-200">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 sm:px-8">

    <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center">

      <!-- Left: Description -->
      <div>
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50 px-3.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-amber-800 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3.5">
          School Forms Integration
        </div>

        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl leading-tight">
          Register students using SF-10 &amp; SF-9 forms.
        </h2>

        <p class="mt-4 text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          TIS RMS uses the official <strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">School Form 10 (SF-10)</strong> and <strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">School Form 9 (SF-9)</strong> as the fastest way to add student basic information into the system from old documents.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-5 rounded-xl border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50/80 p-4 text-sm text-amber-900 leading-relaxed shadow-xs">
          <strong class="font-bold text-amber-950">Administrative Note:</strong> TIS RMS is specifically scoped for digitizing basic learner profiles from historical records (2021 onwards). It is <strong>not an enrollment system</strong> and does not track grading periods.
        </div>

        <div class="mt-7 space-y-3.5">

          <div class="flex items-start gap-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200/90 bg-white p-5 shadow-xs transition hover:border-slate-300">
            <div class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#ecfdf5] text-[#15803d] font-bold text-base">1</div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-display text-base font-bold text-slate-900">School Form 10 (SF-10)</h3>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">The primary source for learner profile data — captures name, LRN, birth date, gender, and originating school.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200/90 bg-white p-5 shadow-xs transition hover:border-slate-300">
            <div class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-amber-50 text-amber-700 font-bold text-base">2</div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-display text-base font-bold text-slate-900">School Form 9 (SF-9)</h3>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">A secondary document used to cross-reference learner identifiers and school year records from legacy physical folders.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200/90 bg-white p-5 shadow-xs transition hover:border-slate-300">
            <div class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 font-bold text-base">3</div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-display text-base font-bold text-slate-900">Auto-fill SF-10 Spreadsheets</h3>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Once registered, the system exports a pre-filled official DepEd SF-10 Excel file — ready for school reporting and audits.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: Sample record preview -->
      <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-300/80 bg-white shadow-xl">

        <!-- Window bar matching app screenshot -->
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-emerald-800/40 bg-[#15803d] px-5 py-3">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/40"></span>
            <span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/40"></span>
            <span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/40"></span>
            <span class="ml-2 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-white">Student Registration Form</span>
          </div>
          <span class="rounded bg-white/20 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs text-white">SF-10 Parser</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Sample data -->
        <div class="p-6 space-y-4 bg-white">

          <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/70 p-4">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold text-[#15803d] uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Learner Basic Information</p>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
              <div class="rounded-lg bg-white p-3 border border-slate-200/80 shadow-xs">
                <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mb-0.5">LRN</div>
                <div class="text-sm font-bold text-[#15803d] tracking-wide">108297100170</div>
              </div>
              <div class="rounded-lg bg-white p-3 border border-slate-200/80 shadow-xs">
                <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mb-0.5">Full Name</div>
                <div class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900">Garcia, Cris Charles</div>
              </div>
              <div class="rounded-lg bg-white p-3 border border-slate-200/80 shadow-xs">
                <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mb-0.5">Year Level</div>
                <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-amber-700">Grade 7 — JHS</div>
              </div>
              <div class="rounded-lg bg-white p-3 border border-slate-200/80 shadow-xs">
                <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mb-0.5">School</div>
                <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900">Talisay Integrated School</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/70 p-4 space-y-2.5">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-700 uppercase tracking-wider">Document Fields (from SF-10)</p>
            {[
              ["Date of Birth", "April 14, 2009"],
              ["Sex", "Male"],
              ["Originating School", "Talisay Elementary School"],
              ["Document Source", "SF-10 Physical Archive (2021+)"],
            ].map(([field, value]) => (
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-sm border-b border-slate-200/70 pb-2 last:border-0 last:pb-0">
                <span class="text-slate-600">{field}</span>
                <span class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">{value}</span>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 p-3.5">
            <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700">Basic info registration only — <span class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">no grade tracking</span></span>
            <span class="rounded-lg bg-[#15803d] px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-white shadow-xs">Save Record</span>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
